    "Sitr can only cover what it can see, and macOS requires Screen Recording permission for that. The screen is analyzed on this Mac and never stored." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding step 2",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لا يستطيع Sitr تغطية إلا ما يراه، ويتطلب macOS إذن تسجيل الشاشة لذلك. تُحلَّل الشاشة على جهاز Mac هذا ولا تُخزَّن أبدًا."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sitr hides people on your screen as they appear — women, men, or everyone — in every app: browsers, chats, photos, video, calls." : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding step 1",
